WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:03.333
Ally couldn't wait to ask Ray about the coffee truck.

2
00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:07.410
But first she had some apologies to make.

3
00:00:07.411 --> 00:00:11.421
Outside the mayor's office, she called Kate.

4
00:00:11.422 --> 00:00:14.611
"I have to tell you something," Ally said.

5
00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:17.182
"I didn't lose my phone.

6
00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.385
I just didn't want you asking to see my phone all the time.

7
00:00:21.386 --> 00:00:23.854
I'm so sorry I fibbed!"

8
00:00:23.855 --> 00:00:31.834
Kate was quiet. Ally was scared that Kate was mad, but then Kate laughed.

9
00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:36.870
"I get it. I don't like it when friends keep asking to borrow my clothes.

10
00:00:36.871 --> 00:00:42.964
I promise to stop asking. And I'll put up signs to find the other phone's owner."

11
00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:47.633
"Great!" Ally said. "Also, can you help me with something?"

12
00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:48.825
"Sure!"

13
00:00:48.826 --> 00:00:52.219
Ally told Kate about the surprise Holly Days party.

14
00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:57.070
"It's tonight. Can you make sure Mateo comes home at exactly six?"

15
00:00:57.071 --> 00:00:58.729
"No problem!"

16
00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:02.373
Ally got Julius' number from Kate.

17
00:01:02.374 --> 00:01:06.754
Then she called him to apologize for hurting his feelings twice.

18
00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:10.749
"It's been a rough week, but I'd really like to be friends.

19
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.031
Can you forgive me?"

20
00:01:13.032 --> 00:01:15.873
Julius stayed quiet too.

21
00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:18.758
"He hates me," Ally thought.

22
00:01:18.759 --> 00:01:23.593
"I understand," Julius said softly. "Thanks for telling me."

23
00:01:23.594 --> 00:01:27.623
Ally told Julius about the party and invited him.

24
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:31.522
"See you then!" Julius said.

25
00:01:31.523 --> 00:01:39.926
"I'll make my next apology in person," Ally thought, heading to the diner.

26
00:01:39.927 --> 00:01:41.918
Ray was in the office.

27
00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:45.553
"Hi, Ally! I was just thinking about that surprise party.

28
00:01:45.554 --> 00:01:49.379
I'll need to order food. Do you know what menu they want?"

29
00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.769
"Uh, Ray, there is no surprise party.

30
00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:58.755
At least not here. Barry was helping me plan something for Mateo.

31
00:01:58.756 --> 00:02:02.499
I wanted to explain, but you were on the phone and . . ."

32
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:08.443
Ray looked confused, but he nodded. "Okay, no big deal.

33
00:02:08.444 --> 00:02:12.737
But why are you throwing Mateo a party? It's not his birthday."

34
00:02:12.738 --> 00:02:16.824
"I wanted to do something nice for him before I go to space."

35
00:02:16.825 --> 00:02:23.094
Ally explained her idea. "It's just a few friends coming over tonight. Is that okay?"

36
00:02:23.095 --> 00:02:24.553
"Sure."

37
00:02:24.554 --> 00:02:33.209
"I have another exciting thing to ask you." Ally told Ray about her idea.

38
00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:38.921
"A coffee food truck sounds great, but I don't have anyone who can run it," Ray said.

39
00:02:38.922 --> 00:02:47.166
"Oh yes you do!" Ally said.

40
00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:57.217
Ally was decorating for the Holly Days party when the doorbell rang.

41
00:02:57.218 --> 00:03:02.320
"Wow, it looks great in here!" Barry said, carrying in food.

42
00:03:02.321 --> 00:03:04.762
"Thanks!"

43
00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:09.614
Soon everything was laid out on the table.

44
00:03:09.615 --> 00:03:15.033
"Great job, Barry. It looks delicious!"

45
00:03:15.034 --> 00:03:21.427
"Your mixed-up menu was fun to make," Barry said. "I hope Ray likes it too."

46
00:03:21.428 --> 00:03:27.025
"Me too," Ally said. "I can't wait for Mateo and everyone to get here."

47
00:03:27.026 --> 00:03:28.736
Soon the front door opened.

48
00:03:28.737 --> 00:03:34.442
In came Ray, Flo, Kate, Bethany, Julius, and Mateo.

49
00:03:34.443 --> 00:03:38.777
"Happy Holly Days!" Ally cried.

50
00:03:38.778 --> 00:03:42.373
"Wow!" Mateo looked around.

51
00:03:42.374 --> 00:03:45.689
"You remembered how much I love the holidays!"

52
00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:52.878
"Yes! And now, I don't have to miss any when I go to—uh, space!" Ally said.

53
00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:57.409
"I can't believe you did all this on your own," Mateo said.

54
00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:05.198
"Barry helped," Ally said. "We planned the menu together, but he cooked everything."

55
00:04:05.199 --> 00:04:11.321
"Oh! The menu is surprising, but it looks delicious!" Ray said.

56
00:04:11.322 --> 00:04:15.920
Ally pulled Ray aside. "What do you think about my food truck idea now?"

57
00:04:15.921 --> 00:04:19.418
"I agree! Let's ask Barry to run it," Ray said.

58
00:04:19.419 --> 00:04:22.181
"Thanks to you, I see he's a good cook."

59
00:04:22.182 --> 00:04:28.832
Ally beamed. "Soon I'll be telling my parents all about my good deeds," she thought.

60
00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:32.091
"Everyone, dig in!" Ally called.

61
00:04:32.092 --> 00:04:39.589
She started to fill her own plate with food when her phone buzzed. It was Lainie.

62
00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:45.426
"I'm calling to tell you some news, Ally. I'm canceling the launch."

63
00:04:45.427 --> 00:04:49.036
"What?" Ally's heart sank.

64
00:04:49.037 --> 00:04:52.170
"You were right," Lainie said.

65
00:04:52.171 --> 00:04:58.868
"Saving endangered species is a much better use of my money than exploring space.

66
00:04:58.869 --> 00:05:05.746
So, I'm investing in a wildlife refuge. Gotta go! Bye!"

67
00:05:05.747 --> 00:05:08.578
"Oh no," Ally thought.

68
00:05:08.579 --> 00:05:15.085
"I was so close to going back home, and now . . ." She stood there, trying not to cry.

69
00:05:15.086 --> 00:05:17.491
Then someone hurried to her side.

70
00:05:17.492 --> 00:05:20.961
"Ally, are you all right?" Julius asked.

71
00:05:20.962 --> 00:05:27.142
Ally blinked back tears. "Lainie canceled the launch!"

72
00:05:27.143 --> 00:05:33.028
"I'm so sorry," Julius said.

73
00:05:33.029 --> 00:05:43.065
"I, um, know this isn't as cool as going to space, but would you maybe . . . want to go to the movies with me sometime?"

74
00:05:43.066 --> 00:05:46.098
"I'd love to!" Ally burst out.

75
00:05:46.099 --> 00:05:49.586
Julius grinned at her, and she smiled back.

76
00:05:49.587 --> 00:05:52.595
"It's not all bad news," she thought.

77
00:05:52.596 --> 00:05:57.548
"Because of me, Lainie is going to save endangered species.

78
00:05:57.549 --> 00:06:00.888
I get to spend more time with my friends.

79
00:06:00.889 --> 00:06:07.905
And I have a movie date—with a very cute Earthling!"

